    <briefdescription>
<para>Layout manager for rest-based UI arrangement. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classevab_1_1_boxy_rest" kindref="compound">BoxyRest</ref> provides a fluent interface for organizing UI elements in a rest. Each <ref refid="classevab_1_1_boxy_rest_1ae2d2fd2c3c0383bfd6d8620bc2712b6b" kindref="member">CutRow()</ref>/CutCol() returns a new <ref refid="classevab_1_1_boxy_rest" kindref="compound">BoxyRest</ref> representing the cell.</para>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classevab_1_1_boxy_rest_1aa41d9cc0860a116cde2da67ceb2b3bc2" kindref="member">BoxyRest</ref><sp/>rest({0,0},<sp/>{16,8});</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">rest.CutRow(2).Draw(element1);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">rest.CutRow(2).CutCol(2).Draw(element2);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">rest.CutRow(2).CutCol(2).Clear();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">rest.Clear();</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
